---
/*
  Monogram: the TD mark from public/favicon.svg, drawn for title blocks: a serif T (Instrument
  Serif) and the gold dot, in a hairline square. Decorative (aria-hidden); size it with CSS
  (.dwg-mono, 1em by default).
*/
---

<svg class="dwg-mono" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <rect class="dwg-mono__box" x="0.5" y="0.5" width="39" height="39" rx="7" />
  <text class="dwg-mono__t" x="17" y="31.5" text-anchor="middle">T</text>
  <circle class="dwg-mono__dot" cx="28.2" cy="28.6" r="3.1" />
</svg>
